{"id":"double_","lemma":"doublé","pos":"noun","rank":4946,"glosses":["double, brace, pair","double","doublé"],"ipa":"/du.ble/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5d/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-doubl%C3%A9.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-doubl%C3%A9.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"doublés"},"examples":[{"text":"Je déteste les films doublés.","en":"I hate dubbed movies.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1102738","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate, to detest","l":"détester"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"movie, film","l":"film"},null]},{"text":"Le nombre d'employés a doublé en dix ans.","en":"The number of employees doubled in ten years.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"number"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"employee","l":"employé"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"ten"},{"g":"year","l":"an"}]},{"text":"Je n'aime pas les films doublés.","en":"I don't like dubbed movies.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"movie, film","l":"film"},null]},{"text":"Leur voiture a doublé la nôtre.","en":"Their car passed ours.","words":[{"g":"them"},{"g":"car"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Notre navire a doublé le cap ce matin.","en":"Our ship rounded the cape this morning.","words":[{"g":"our"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,null,null,{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"morning"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"Cape Town"]]}]}